X-SOURCE:Meetup: History of Parkdale
UID:event_314890266@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260603T050342Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T163000
SUMMARY:Crazy Historic Hidden Laneways of Toronto\, and Graffiti Alley! 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto History Walks\n\\*\\***The Toronto History Walks Yearl
 y Pass is available. Get it now for $125.00 for 1 year of unlimited tours\
 , email**\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**\n**for more information or fo
 r signing up!\\*\\***\n\n\\*\\* **Please note: Please e-transfer the ticke
 t amount when booking your space for this tour! You can e-transfer to the 
 following email at:**\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**\n\nTake a walk an
 d uncover history!\n\nExplore a laneway in Toronto\, and find interesting 
 houses\, architecture\, hidden treasures of this city. Most walkers ignore
  the laneways\, especially the hidden ones\, and see a different side of T
 oronto\, let's get out and uncover something different and special\, that'
 s all I'm saying\, see you there!\n\nIt started out as Rush Lane\, but gra
 ffiti alley today is a gritty\, fascinating look into street art\, and the
  artists who have created a space to linger and to discuss. It's far more 
 than just a lane in the heart of Toronto\, it's a conversation starter! Co
 me and see for yourself.\n\nThis walking tour is for all levels and walker
 s. The tour begins on the northeast side of Margaret Fairley Park at 100 B
 runswick Avenue\, east of Bathurst Street. We end the tour at Spadina Aven
 ue and Queen Street West.\n\nThis tour has a ticket price of $15.00 per pe
 rson.\n\n\\*\\* **Please note: Please e-transfer the ticket amount when bo
 oking your space for this tour! You can e-transfer to the following email 
 at:**\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/the-history-of-parkdale/events/314890
 266/
